#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2401
msgid ""
"Reaction AFTER the trigger:\n"
"  Stop = classic BP, halts the emulator\n"
"  Log only = TTY output + continue (log \"BP X\"; continue)\n"
"  Custom = full mini-DSL script\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/action-dsl.md"
msgstr ""
"トリガー後の反応:\n"
"  Stop = 古典的BP、エミュレータを停止\n"
"  Log only = TTY出力 + 継続 (log \"BP X\"; continue)\n"
"  Custom = 完全なミニDSLスクリプト\n"
"参照: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/action-dsl.md"

